(text "BQ24072: EN1=VSYS, EN2=0: USB500. R11=2k: ~445 mA charge.\nTMR=0: timers disabled for 10 Ah pack. TD=0: termination enabled.\nJ5: external 10k NTC (103AT-2) on cell; R10 DNP. Protected 1S / 4.2 V pack.\nSwitch disconnects load; charging remains active. Use a 5 V / >=500 mA source.\nBacklight: six top-emitting white LEDs from VDDH; 1k each, PWM via BL_EN." (at 20.32 254 0)
